OlvRoc

This folder contains code and data derived from VieNeu-TTS
(https://github.com/pnnbao97/VieNeu-TTS, commit bd0f88e) by Phạm Nguyễn Ngọc Bảo,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes: renamed; engine.py trimmed to preset-voice synthesis on CPU (voice
cloning and streaming removed); tts.py rewritten; comments edited.

The model files listed in model_files.json come from the Hugging Face repositories
pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-TTS-v3-Turbo and OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano-ONNX,
both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Their file names and the
names inside the .onnx and config.json files are renamed when they are installed.
